msgstr "目录名 `lift2s-ws` 为示例。工作空间仓库本身是公开的。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md:20
#: 8e45e100135f4f179e3a4d09fabe944c
msgid "**Public HTTPS** (no SSH key for the top-level clone):"
msgstr "**公开 HTTPS**（顶层克隆不需要 SSH 密钥）："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md:22
#: be54dbb4ed0f4660a64a44fd1716b846
msgid ""
"cd ~\n"
"git clone -b arx-lift2s https://github.com/fiveages-sim/open-deploy-"
"ws.git lift2s-ws\n"
"cd ~/lift2s-ws"
msgstr ""
"cd ~\n"
"git clone -b arx-lift2s https://github.com/fiveages-sim/open-deploy-"
"ws.git lift2s-ws\n"
"cd ~/lift2s-ws"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md:28
#: 9e9a8bc41831442fbdaf9182672e2632
msgid ""
"Then follow the branch README: `./init_repo.sh`, or a field zip plus "
"`./release.sh --install` then `./quick_start.sh`. Descriptions stay as "
"source; controllers / hardware interface come from `.deb`."
msgstr ""
"随后按分支 README：`./init_repo.sh`，或现场 zip 加上 `./release.sh --install` 再 "
"`./quick_start.sh`。描述保持源码；控制器 / 硬件接口来自 `.deb`。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md:30
#: 1d39852a521543e58445c4dcf518f431
msgid "**Developer SSH** (nested private modules when you have keys):"
msgstr "**开发者 SSH**（已有密钥、需要嵌套私有模块时）："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md:32
#: 0713d0e945fc4af2944983ef7d6b3f95
msgid ""
"cd ~\n"
"git clone -b arx-lift2s git@github.com:fiveages-sim/open-deploy-ws.git "
"lift2s-ws\n"
"cd ~/lift2s-ws\n"
"./init_repo.sh"
msgstr ""
"cd ~\n"
"git clone -b arx-lift2s git@github.com:fiveages-sim/open-deploy-ws.git "
"lift2s-ws\n"
"cd ~/lift2s-ws\n"
"./init_repo.sh"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md:39
#: 11f9bd48dd11404cbfcd421f9b82c368
msgid "Build and launch (scripts first)"
msgstr "编译与启动（脚本优先）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md:41
#: 65aa49e739d04d56bdea41daba521a19
msgid ""
"Primary path is `./quick_start.sh` (scenario build + Lift2S split/full "
"body, simulation or real):"
msgstr "主路径是 `./quick_start.sh`（按场景编译 + Lift2S 分身/全身，仿真或真机）："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md:43
#: d2ebdecde2654fe09efbad7fca566b5a
msgid ""
"cd ~/lift2s-ws\n"
"./quick_start.sh"
msgstr ""
"cd ~/lift2s-ws\n"
"./quick_start.sh"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md:48
#: df996edb568c490db8d487a4185d3f2c
msgid "README menu:"
msgstr "README 菜单："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md:50
#: bad9efe2a5134affbc5ce4831386f99c
msgid ""
"**Build** — simulation packages, or real-hardware packages (includes "
"`arx_ros2_control`)"
msgstr "**编译** — 仿真软件包，或真机软件包（含 `arx_ros2_control`）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md:51
#: fd51a74471784df38c7e6ca8b8881854
msgid ""
"**Launch** — choose **Lift2S**, then **split body** (分体控制) or **full "
"body** (全身控制), then simulation (`mock_components`) or **real hardware**. "
"See [分体控制 vs 全身控制](../../../3-concepts/7-split_vs_wbc.md)."
msgstr ""
"**启动** — 选择 **Lift2S**，再选 **分体控制** 或 **全身控制**，然后仿真（`mock_components`）或 "
"**真机**。见 [分体控制 vs 全身控制](../../../3-concepts/7-split_vs_wbc.md)。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md:53
#: ecbd3c6816424304833d10c27b0b6aa4
msgid ""
"CAN (README): left/right arms `can1` / `can3`; no network IP. Lift axis "
"defaults to `hybrid` (change to `soft_p` in `quick_start`)."
msgstr ""
"CAN（README）：左右臂 `can1` / `can3`；没有网络 IP。升降轴默认 `hybrid`（可在 `quick_start` "
"中改为 `soft_p`）。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md:55
#: 27791fb987ba4e958e66a5bcef990da1
msgid ""
"X5 / R5 / **ACone** / Lift / X7S in the same menu are `robot-"
"descriptions-arx` models for **co-debug**. Pick **ACone** only when you "
"want the **arm**, not the full Lift 2S chassis."
msgstr ""
"同一菜单中的 X5 / R5 / **ACone** / Lift / X7S 是用于 **联调** 的 `robot-descriptions-"
"arx` 模型。只有在需要 **机械臂**、而不是完整 Lift 2S 底盘时才选 **ACone**。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md:57
#: e5749543b6d749e6bb0a697cae571fa2
msgid "Optional README launch lines"
msgstr "README 中的可选 launch 行"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md:59
#: d2685a363ed84ee59d26bf2ebea9883f
msgid ""
"Prefer the script. These are the README’s optional equivalents for "
"**Lift2S**. Omit `hardware:=` for simulation — the launch default is "
"`mock_components`. Pass `hardware:=real` on the robot."
msgstr ""
"优先用脚本。以下是 README 中 **Lift2S** 的可选等价命令。仿真省略 `hardware:=` — launch 默认是 "
"`mock_components`。真机再传 `hardware:=real`。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md:61
#: cb5a152311c6432cb6a6873c1d24fa04
msgid ""
"source ~/lift2s-ws/install/setup.bash\n"
"# Visualization\n"
"ros2 launch robot_common_launch manipulator.launch.py robot:=arx_lift2s\n"
"# Simulation / mock_components default — omit hardware:=\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller split_body.launch.py robot:=arx_lift2s\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller full_body.launch.py robot:=arx_lift2s\n"
"# Real robot\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller split_body.launch.py robot:=arx_lift2s "
"hardware:=real\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller full_body.launch.py robot:=arx_lift2s "
"hardware:=real"
msgstr ""
"source ~/lift2s-ws/install/setup.bash\n"
"# Visualization\n"
"ros2 launch robot_common_launch manipulator.launch.py robot:=arx_lift2s\n"
"# Simulation / mock_components default — omit hardware:=\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller split_body.launch.py robot:=arx_lift2s\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller full_body.launch.py robot:=arx_lift2s\n"
"# Real robot\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller split_body.launch.py robot:=arx_lift2s "
"hardware:=real\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller full_body.launch.py robot:=arx_lift2s "
"hardware:=real"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md:73
#: ee9e6124808e4af0ad156529f8096508
msgid ""
"Those OCS2 launches also take `type` / `left_type` / `right_type` from "
"[robot_common_launch](../../../4-reference/descriptions/2-common.md) "
"(`create_robot_profile_launch_arguments()`). Different L/R: `left_type:=`"
" and `right_type:=` together; **do not pass `type:=`** then. "
"Visualization `manipulator.launch.py` uses the same first-class args."
msgstr ""
"这些 OCS2 launch 也接收 "
"[robot_common_launch](../../../4-reference/descriptions/2-common.md) 的 "
"`type` / `left_type` / "
"`right_type`（`create_robot_profile_launch_arguments()`）。左右不同：同时传 "
"`left_type:=` 与 `right_type:=`；此时**不要再传 `type:=`**。可视化 "
"`manipulator.launch.py` 使用同一套一等参数。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md:75
#: 306f2a305ab94297a206c37ee4e16321
msgid ""
"Zenoh: README asks for `sudo apt install ros-jazzy-rmw-zenoh-cpp` and "
"`export RMW_IMPLEMENTATION=rmw_zenoh_cpp` on the deploy host."
msgstr ""
"Zenoh：README 要求在部署主机上执行 `sudo apt install ros-jazzy-rmw-zenoh-cpp` 并 "
"`export RMW_IMPLEMENTATION=rmw_zenoh_cpp`。"

